      "content": "hey so i had the flu like 3 weeks ago and i thought i was over it but lately i've just been feeling super wiped out. like even walking up the stairs makes me really out of breath and my heart feels like it's racing or thumping weird in my chest sometimes. is this just like long term fatigue from being sick or should i be worried??",
